   1 |        895.3    614.1 |      867.7 |        987.9    556.5 |  0.969  1.138  1.103 |      51.0 | ok (rel 0.0154)
   2 |        880.1    624.6 |      860.9 |       1000.0    549.8 |  0.978  1.162  1.136 |      50.3 | ok (rel 0.0154)
